  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7af8a1d1-ab33-546a-9588-2fa64d7e0fbe" activityNameId="9b8b688a-23ee-579c-9b4a-94e9fe79ebbe" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Tetrachloroethylene, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Tetrachloroethylene, at regional storage
Transport from European production plants to Switzerland. Due to the cumulated data used in the product system inventory of methyl chloride production only selected ressources and emissions are included (according to methodology of Boustead). No land occupation and land use is included in the main production process for methyl chloride. No uncertainity is applied to this preceeding process.;
CAS number: 000127-18-4; 
Formula: C2Cl4; 
Synonyms: perchloroethylene, ethylene tetrachloride, tetrachloroethene, carbon dichloride, PER, Perc; 
UUID: 5b56b412-592a-3a86-b7b0-30aa4bc9c0c2
Raw materials, average transport from Production within Europe to Switzerland, emissions to air from tank storage, estimation for storage infrastructure.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Assumed that all methyl chloride used in Switzerland origins European production plants. Emission values for storage and handling from chloroform production from a U.S source. For the infrastructure as approximation tank infrastructure for methanol or fuel was used .
Time period: Time of literature publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Representativity of the assumed transport distances and the used modal split was not determined. No imports from Oversea included. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5b56b412-592a-3a86-b7b0-30aa4bc9c0c2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
